            "display_title": "Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer fPwG",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Part-based bird classifiers with an explainable, editable language bottleneck"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "M3LcbymXFy",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "1/3 The multi-step training strategy is necessary due to the multi-objecives setup in our framework.",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer fPwG"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "kwhAN4WgGz",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "2/3 We follow the conventional ZSL and GZSL protocols to ensure our reported results are comparable to prior works.",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer fPwG"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "4mHx8JRARr",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "3/3 PEEB's predictions are self-explainable, as they derive both class and box predictions from the same embeddings.",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer fPwG"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "M8LibXwE6n",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer AaGv",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Part-based bird classifiers with an explainable, editable language bottleneck"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "mF0qyzmvNR",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "1/3 Our novelty is transforming object detector into a self-explainable image classifier with a language bottleneck",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer AaGv"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "CiBPr4y9st",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "2/3 Our proposed method achieves comparable results to SoTA methods in both the text-, concept-, and part-based methods.",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer AaGv"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "nId2T8TO5Q",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "3/3 Our ablation study shows that the failure in classification mainly due to the mismatch between desciptions and part-embeddings.",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer AaGv"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "8BX8sOKOz8",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer 4q8P",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Part-based bird classifiers with an explainable, editable language bottleneck"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "U9qNQDGRV0",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "1/5 thank you so much! we've updated the paper to include comparisons with suggested methods",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer 4q8P"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "xYoXBQfNny",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "2/5 PEEB better or comparable to state-of-the-art in non-attribute-based classifiers on ZSL, GZSL and Supervised learning settings",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer 4q8P"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "rnTLaexRXa",
          "fields": {
            "display_title": "3/5 PEEB is the state-of-the-art on part-based bird classifier",
            "replying_to": "Replying to Official Review of Submission5768 by Reviewer 4q8P"
          }
        },
        {
          "note_id": "DnGpwZmqWL",
          "fields": {
